# Check text files out with LF on every OS. The repo already stores LF, but
# Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true got CRLF working copies, which broke
# the tests that read source files and made vitest rewrite snapshot files.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
